package provide SimileAutoObj 1.0

# Notes
# must be pipe interface
# must be in the Simile distribution tree

# todo
# ModelWindowImpl expose more hai2mmii.tcl
# update SetValue code to use global arrays
#
# RunControlImpl  need to set submodel timesteps
#    SetExecuteFor DOESN'T EFFECT RUN!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

